  "title": "Platform Strategy — All Hands",
  "notes": "The most common real idiom: dark --deck-* contract with literal values, compact font: shorthands (dropped by the editor's longhand-only copy), mono section numbers, border-top/left accents, <br> in body copy, plus a slide the editor already touched (data-slide-inline-style spans, a legacy scoped <style>, a dragged label).",
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "compact-platform",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg:#0b0d0c;--deck-ink:#f2f5f3;--deck-muted:#8f9a94;--deck-accent:#4ade80;--deck-surface:#121614;--deck-heading-font:'Geist',sans-serif;--deck-body-font:'Geist',sans-serif;--deck-radius:6px;background:var(--deck-bg);color:var(--deck-ink);padding:64px 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;font-family:var(--deck-body-font);position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"font:600 13px 'Geist Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--deck-accent);text-transform:uppercase\">04 / The opportunity</div><h2 style=\"font:500 36px/1.1 'Geist',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin:0;max-width:780px\">Every team will run on a few shared internal apps.</h2><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;max-width:780px\"><div style=\"font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#dfe5e1\">Spreadsheets and ticket queues are where work goes to wait</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#dfe5e1\">Small, focused apps replace them one workflow at a time</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--deck-accent)\">We give teams the kit to build them</div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-two-bets",
      "layout": "two-column",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg:#0b0d0c;--deck-ink:#f2f5f3;--deck-muted:#8f9a94;--deck-accent:#4ade80;--deck-surface:#121614;--deck-heading-font:'Geist',sans-serif;--deck-body-font:'Geist',sans-serif;--deck-radius:6px;background:var(--deck-bg);color:var(--deck-ink);padding:64px 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;font-family:var(--deck-body-font);position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"font:600 13px 'Geist Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--deck-accent);text-transform:uppercase\">05 / Two bets</div><h2 style=\"font:500 34px/1.12 'Geist',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin:0;max-width:820px\">Open source earns trust.<br>The hosted product earns revenue.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:10px\"><div style=\"border-top:2px solid var(--deck-accent);padding-top:14px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#dfe5e1\">The framework gives developers a foundation they can read, fork and self-host</div><div style=\"border-top:2px solid #4ade80;padding-top:14px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#dfe5e1\">The hosted product gives every team a place to build without running servers</div></div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;border-left:3px solid #f2f5f3;padding:12px 18px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#dfe5e1\">Large customers want both:<br>the code they can audit and the service they don't have to run</div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-previously-edited",
      "layout": "content",
      "notes": "This slide was edited by hand before; the markup carries the editor's leftovers.",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide allhands-slide\" style=\"--deck-bg:#0b0d0c;--deck-ink:#f2f5f3;--deck-muted:#8f9a94;--deck-accent:#4ade80;background:var(--deck-bg);color:var(--deck-ink);padding:56px 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><style>[data-slide-content-scope=\"slide-_r_j_\"] .allhands-slide * { box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; }</style><div style=\"position:relative\"><div style=\"font:600 13px 'Geist Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--deck-accent);text-transform:uppercase;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;user-select:none;box-sizing:border-box;width:800px;height:16px;display:block\" class=\"fmd-layout-spacer\" data-slide-layout-spacer-for=\"obj-label-06\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div style=\"font:600 13px / normal 'Geist Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:3px;color:rgb(74, 222, 128);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0px;position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:800px;height:16px;box-sizing:border-box;white-space:normal\" data-slide-object-id=\"obj-label-06\" class=\"fmd-freeform-object\">06 / What we ship next</div></div><h2 style=\"font:500 34px/1.12 'Geist',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin:0\">Three launches before <span data-slide-inline-style=\"true\" style=\"color:rgb(74, 222, 128)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(74, 222, 128)\">the end of the year</span></span></h2><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:6px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font:600 12px 'Geist Mono',monospace;color:#4ade80;padding-top:5px;flex-shrink:0\">01</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#dfe5e1\"><span data-slide-inline-style=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Workflow templates</span> for finance, support and ops</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font:600 12px 'Geist Mono',monospace;color:#4ade80;padding-top:5px;flex-shrink:0\">02</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#dfe5e1\">Single sign-on and audit logs for every plan</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font:600 12px 'Geist Mono',monospace;color:#4ade80;padding-top:5px;flex-shrink:0\">03</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#dfe5e1\">A marketplace where teams share the apps they build</span></div></div></div>"
    }
